## Notes
- Validation layers NOT installed on this rig; VK_LAYER_KHRONOS_validation assertions skipped.
- clangd/LSP reports false pp_file_not_found errors on image.cpp because compile_commands.json is
  only exported for Debug builds (CMakeLists.txt:22); authoritative compiler build is green.
- vkGetImageSubresourceLayout chosen over vkGetImageSubresourceLayout2: both exchange formats are
  single-plane color formats, no pNext metadata needed, core-1.0 availability (Layout2 would need
  VK_KHR_maintenance5/Vulkan 1.4).
- Import memory-type selection: vkGetMemoryFdPropertiesKHR(DMA_BUF).memoryTypeBits ∩
  reqs.memoryTypeBits, device-local preferred within intersection, any-bit fallback; plain
  findMemoryTypeIndex retained ONLY for own allocations and the legacy OPAQUE_FD import.
- fd hygiene: imported fd close()d on GetMemoryFdPropertiesKHR failure, empty-intersection, and
  vkAllocateMemory failure (ownership NOT transferred); on success driver owns it. Exported fds
  from exportDmaBuf()/legacy exportFd out-param are caller-owned.
- git diff -w verified: only intended hunks across the four owned files; semaphore/exchange/
  CMakeLists changes in tree belong to concurrent todos 3/4 and are NOT staged by this commit.
